<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday the following issues were unavailable for after hours trading:</p>
<p>Choice Hotels, news dissemination.</p>
<p>Saga Petroleum class A and class B shares;</p>
<p>Corimon SACA.</p>
